{"3851150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "To The Freedom", "steam_appid": 3851150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're in prison. You need to escape. But do you have what it takes?</strong><br>Guts? Maybe.<br>Willpower? 100%.<br>A get-out-of-jail-free card? In your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Front gate keys? You’ll have to steal them from the guards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight guards and take their keys! Not strong enough? Hit the gym. Everyone starts as fresh meat, but some climb their way up to become the top dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tools?</strong> <strong>Check out other inmates’ stashes.</strong><br>Everyone hides something around here.<br>Even if you can't find what you want, you can gather materials and craft it. Don’t know how? Visit the library. You may not be an engineer, but you’re smart enough to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can’t steal? Then buy.</strong><br>Some prisoners use their status to access forbidden areas. Others smuggle contrabands from the outside. If you’ve got the cash, you can get anything—from a paperclip to a burner phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No money?</strong><br>If you're ready to get your hands dirty, there are always shady jobs from fellow inmates.<br>Want to stay clean? Work for the prison industry. The pay’s low, but it grants access to restricted zones and restricted items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can’t take on the guards or gangs alone?</strong><br>Then build your crew:<br>The muscle, the resource guy, the funny one, and the mastermind behind the escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just find the way out.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're in prison. You need to escape. But do you have what it takes?</strong><br>Guts? Maybe.<br>Willpower? 100%.<br>A get-out-of-jail-free card? In your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Front gate keys? You’ll have to steal them from the guards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight guards and take their keys! Not strong enough? Hit the gym. Everyone starts as fresh meat, but some climb their way up to become the top dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tools?</strong> <strong>Check out other inmates’ stashes.</strong><br>Everyone hides something around here.<br>Even if you can't find what you want, you can gather materials and craft it. Don’t know how? Visit the library. You may not be an engineer, but you’re smart enough to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can’t steal? Then buy.</strong><br>Some prisoners use their status to access forbidden areas. Others smuggle contrabands from the outside. If you’ve got the cash, you can get anything—from a paperclip to a burner phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No money?</strong><br>If you're ready to get your hands dirty, there are always shady jobs from fellow inmates.<br>Want to stay clean? Work for the prison industry. The pay’s low, but it grants access to restricted zones and restricted items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can’t take on the guards or gangs alone?</strong><br>Then build your crew:<br>The muscle, the resource guy, the funny one, and the mastermind behind the escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just find the way out.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Study, train, get stronger. You'll need everything to escape from the bizarre prisons of To the Freedom. Need tools? Buy, steal, or craft. Keys? Beat up guards. Money? Work prison industries or get your hands dirty. Oh, and you’ve got 3 friends to plan the big escape!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851150/f5ad3cec7cb7cc54f253b2b38981dbd3dda8adbb/header.jpg?t=1786009965", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851150/0cebcb7bc813e9a20d0672a2526d2a9b3958873e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786009965", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851150/0cebcb7bc813e9a20d0672a2526d2a9b3958873e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786009965", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960  / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F / AMD ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Furce's Game World"], "publishers": ["Furce's Game World"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfor